01:42.290 --> 01:47.130
Kawaii dake janai miryoku

01:47.500 --> 01:52.710
Ima wa tada sora o miageru watashi no

01:52.880 --> 02:00.920
Kokoro ni mebaeta atarashii chikara o shinjiru no

02:01.040 --> 02:03.500
Akogareru dake janakute

02:03.750 --> 02:06.130
Yume ni miru dake janakute

02:06.290 --> 02:08.920
Naritai kawaritai

02:09.080 --> 02:11.580
Suki ga watashi no minamoto

02:11.830 --> 02:18.000
Hitomi no oku ga ubawareteshimatta hi kara

02:18.000 --> 02:24.540
Zutto iroasenai My Dream Girls

02:24.830 --> 02:25.830
Cho cute

02:27.170 --> 02:27.960
Touching

02:30.250 --> 02:31.080
Cho cool

02:32.250 --> 02:33.080
Charming

02:37.880 --> 02:41.790
<b>Neroalice in Wonderland</b>

02:41.790 --> 02:46.170
<b>Come to Nacht Base after school.</b>

02:41.790 --> 02:46.170
<b>Bring Leoparde, too. See you there.</b>

02:51.420 --> 02:54.630
What do you think Vena-san wants?

02:56.170 --> 02:58.290
Probably something annoying.

03:05.670 --> 03:07.250
We're here.

03:08.000 --> 03:11.960
V..Vena-san? You wanted us?

03:12.500 --> 03:16.040
Utena-chan, let's ditch this place and go to a hotel.

03:16.040 --> 03:18.040
N-not right now.

03:18.630 --> 03:23.170
Utena, Kiwi! There you are.

03:30.250 --> 03:31.250
Who is that?

03:32.000 --> 03:34.460
This is Korisu Morino.

03:34.920 --> 03:39.330
She's your new teammate.
Make her feel welcome, mmkay?

03:39.710 --> 03:43.710
W-wait, she's our new teammate?

03:44.170 --> 03:44.880
Uh-huh.

03:50.380 --> 03:53.540
V..Vena-san, can we talk?

03:56.210 --> 04:01.750
What is wrong with you?!
Did you seriously kidnap a little girl?!

04:02.000 --> 04:07.380
Wow, I'm not THAT evil. I didn't trick her
into joining us or anything, either.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.380
Huh?

04:09.330 --> 04:13.130
Yep, all's going according to plan.

04:13.960 --> 04:16.000
Sounds like things are going well on your end, too.

04:16.830 --> 04:21.250
Don't worry about that.
Let's just keep our eye on it for a bit.

04:36.790 --> 04:39.500
Wanna join our evil organization?

04:40.080 --> 04:41.540
And now she's here.

04:42.170 --> 04:45.670
Shouldn't you have higher standards
for people joining your organization?

04:46.000 --> 04:48.170
Nah, it's totally fine.

04:48.540 --> 04:49.380
Whoa.

04:50.790 --> 04:51.920
Oh, boy.

04:52.790 --> 04:56.170
Wow... Looks like she really likes Vena-san.

04:57.380 --> 05:00.040
Trying to act cute won't work on us!

05:00.290 --> 05:04.540
C'mon, pipsqueak, show your betters some respect!

05:05.830 --> 05:07.330
Kiwi-chan...

05:12.330 --> 05:15.790
Utena-chan, she's super socially awkward!

05:15.960 --> 05:18.500
She's just a little kid, y'know...

05:20.000 --> 05:22.540
Hey there, Korisu-chan.

05:23.040 --> 05:26.130
I'm Utena Hiiragi. Let's be friends, okay?

05:30.830 --> 05:37.540
Wow... She's got such big, bright eyes,
and such pretty hair, too.

05:38.290 --> 05:43.460
Let's get straight to business:
we're gonna show off Korisu's powers today.

05:43.830 --> 05:48.630
What?! Y-you're gonna make her fight the Tres Magia?!

05:49.540 --> 05:51.080
You're up for it, right, Korisu?

05:52.170 --> 05:56.330
Y-you shouldn't be, Korisu-chan! You could get hurt!

06:01.080 --> 06:03.040
Okay, Trans Magia.

06:25.380 --> 06:27.080
Hello? She's cute as heck.

06:28.500 --> 06:34.960
Holy crap, you're adorable!
Look at your cutesy Wonderland dress!

06:35.080 --> 06:36.580
I just wanna take you home forever!

06:36.580 --> 06:38.790
I thought I was the cutest!

06:38.960 --> 06:42.790
You're hella cute, Kiwi-chan!
Your military uniform is badass!

06:42.790 --> 06:44.830
You're one million percent cute! I love it!

06:45.210 --> 06:48.710
Yay, thank you!

06:49.210 --> 06:52.330
I love when you transform! You're goddesses!

06:53.170 --> 06:55.540
You're just as bad as I am, y'know.

07:00.750 --> 07:02.540
I don't see Enormita...

07:03.670 --> 07:06.420
I swore I sensed them around here, though...

07:12.670 --> 07:15.750
What is that? It's sus as hell.

07:16.580 --> 07:19.080
Could be a monster?

07:23.630 --> 07:24.960
Hold it!

07:24.960 --> 07:28.080
YOU hold it! Did you not hear me say it's sus?!

07:31.500 --> 07:33.130
Get back here!

07:36.540 --> 07:37.750
Stop!

07:38.580 --> 07:40.040
Wait up, Magenta!

07:42.130 --> 07:44.790
C'mon! Stop running!

07:55.710 --> 07:57.210
Wh-whoopsies.

07:57.210 --> 08:00.380
Are you too stupid to realize this was a trap?!

08:01.790 --> 08:03.710
It's locked. I can't get it open.

08:04.130 --> 08:06.080
Outta the way. I'll bust the bitch down myself.

08:17.420 --> 08:19.290
What?!

08:22.380 --> 08:25.210
What the heck?! Was that the doll from before?!

08:25.380 --> 08:26.920
Who cares? Just run!

08:30.000 --> 08:31.290
Ouchie!

08:36.960 --> 08:37.790
Take this!

08:46.170 --> 08:48.250
EEK!

08:53.880 --> 08:57.250
What are those things?
Our attacks aren't working on them.

08:58.170 --> 08:59.880
What is going on with this place?

09:00.330 --> 09:03.210
I dunno. I dunno, but...

09:04.630 --> 09:07.830
Don't worry, honey. I'll keep you safe.

09:09.920 --> 09:12.960
Magenta? What are you wearing?

09:13.500 --> 09:14.290
Oh, honey...

09:16.580 --> 09:18.540
You're as beautiful as ever.

09:19.380 --> 09:21.420
C'mon, lemme have a kiss.

09:21.420 --> 09:26.750
Whoa-whoa-whoa! Sulfur, help!
Something's wrong with Magenta!

09:26.960 --> 09:27.790
Mommy...

09:29.880 --> 09:32.710
Mommy, I'm hungry.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.630
Wait, Sulfur?!

09:40.130 --> 09:42.920
Mommy... Milkies.

09:46.920 --> 09:50.380
St-stop!

09:51.880 --> 09:54.380
Oh ho? I suppose I'll join you.

09:56.540 --> 09:57.920
What's happening?

09:59.130 --> 10:00.880
Something's wrong with both of them...

10:02.750 --> 10:08.420
Or maybe... I've been acting wrong this whole time.

10:08.960 --> 10:13.170
Am I... their Mommy? Was I always their Mommy?

10:28.130 --> 10:31.000
It's nice to get some private family time, isn't it?

10:31.420 --> 10:34.670
Here, I'll get you nice and clean.

10:45.000 --> 10:48.420
My mind's going blank...

10:56.000 --> 11:01.880
She can use her dollhouse to trap people
and make them do her bidding?

11:02.380 --> 11:09.040
She can control her toys. That's Korisu Morino's power,
or rather, Neroalice's power.

11:09.580 --> 11:13.710
Can't say I get it, but it sounds pretty OP.

11:14.290 --> 11:16.580
Indeed, and useful, too.

11:16.790 --> 11:21.170
Anyone who wanders into her dollhouse
becomes her toy.

11:21.420 --> 11:22.380
However...

11:29.460 --> 11:32.000
Wait, what were we just...

11:32.000 --> 11:34.130
What... What...

11:34.460 --> 11:37.420
What the actual fuck did they just make me do?!

11:38.500 --> 11:40.380
Suck it, morons!

11:40.460 --> 11:43.000
Korisu's powers pack a punch,

11:44.080 --> 11:46.420
but she's still just a little kid.

11:47.330 --> 11:49.750
Korisu-chan, are you feeling sleepy?

11:52.130 --> 11:55.000
Can you help her get home?

11:55.000 --> 11:56.710
Uh, sure.

11:59.630 --> 12:03.170
Korisu-chan sure is cute...

12:03.960 --> 12:07.250
...but she might be the worst out of all of us.

12:13.790 --> 12:16.130
Happy birthday, Korisu!

12:18.000 --> 12:20.880
I've got a present for you! Go on, open it.

12:32.130 --> 12:34.460
Well? Do you like it?

12:35.790 --> 12:40.210
Good! Now, let's enjoy dinner before it gets cold.

12:49.460 --> 12:54.330
I'm bored, I'm bored, I'm super friggin' bored!

12:54.330 --> 12:57.580
I'm glad we get some downtime, but I dunno...

12:58.040 --> 13:01.580
Hey, let's see who can jump further!

13:01.750 --> 13:04.500
Huh? I'm good, thanks.

13:04.580 --> 13:05.330
Hup!

13:07.290 --> 13:09.540
Your turn, Utena-chan!

13:09.540 --> 13:11.960
No, I'd uh, rather not...

13:12.170 --> 13:19.500
Okay, so what else? We could go to a hotel,
or hit up a hotel, or find a room at a hotel...

13:20.670 --> 13:23.210
You sure are into hotels, Kiwi-chan...

13:23.750 --> 13:25.960
Look, I'm bored, okay?

13:27.000 --> 13:28.790
Hey, it's Korisu!

13:29.170 --> 13:30.540
Where's she going?

13:30.540 --> 13:32.830
Heading home from school, probably?

13:33.830 --> 13:37.250
Korisu! You headin' home?

13:37.250 --> 13:38.460
What a surprise to see you.

13:38.960 --> 13:43.000
Oh, hey! Can we go hang out at your place?

13:43.000 --> 13:46.000
What?! You can't just invite us over...

13:48.040 --> 13:49.170
Y-you're sure?

13:50.420 --> 13:53.380
Korisu, which way?

13:53.380 --> 13:54.420
Slow down!

13:55.130 --> 13:56.710
Hello...

13:57.170 --> 13:59.960
Wait, why's no one home?

14:02.920 --> 14:05.040
<b>Korisu,</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.040
<b>please buy yourself</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.040
<b>some dinner.</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.040
<b>Love, Mom</b>

14:05.710 --> 14:07.290
Is your mom at work?

14:10.500 --> 14:13.460
Hey, Korisu! Where're you going?

14:15.250 --> 14:17.330
Is this your room?

14:17.630 --> 14:20.330
Whoa, not bad!

14:24.170 --> 14:26.040
Damn!

14:26.130 --> 14:27.750
That’s a lot of toys.

14:30.420 --> 14:33.540
Some are new, but some are old and beat-up.

14:34.130 --> 14:39.750
She must really love them if she's still holding onto them.

14:40.420 --> 14:44.210
Okay, lemme play with you!

14:51.500 --> 14:52.250
Oh, crap!

14:52.250 --> 14:53.500
Kiwi-chan!

14:53.960 --> 14:56.130
Sorry, Korisu...

15:19.580 --> 15:21.460
Hey, Korisu!

15:22.540 --> 15:28.250
This doll looks tight! What kind is it? Looks antique.

15:29.170 --> 15:32.250
Wait, this one's broken, too.

15:36.040 --> 15:38.790
What, is it special?

15:42.750 --> 15:45.330
Looks like that one's her favorite.

15:47.380 --> 15:53.330
Korisu-chan, if you want, I can fix it for you.

15:53.880 --> 15:56.630
Wait, you know how to do that, Utena-chan?!

15:57.170 --> 16:00.000
My mom taught me when I was little.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.790
Only if you're okay with it, Korisu-chan.

16:03.290 --> 16:08.170
OMG, you're total wife material! Marry me!

16:13.960 --> 16:15.920
I'll get it fixed up for you!

16:18.710 --> 16:20.460
It's frickin' freezing!

16:21.080 --> 16:23.750
It's really windy today, huh...?

16:24.880 --> 16:26.830
See ya later, Utena-chan!

16:26.830 --> 16:28.830
Later, Kiwi-chan.

16:31.710 --> 16:35.290
Now that I'm looking closer,
lots of parts are frayed and beat up...

16:35.790 --> 16:38.960
But Korisu-chan seemed to really treasure this doll.

16:42.130 --> 16:43.460
<b>Korisu,</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:43.460
<b>please buy yourself</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:43.460
<b>some dinner.</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:43.460
<b>Love, Mom</b>

16:45.130 --> 16:49.960
She trusted me to fix her up.
I've got to make sure I do a good job.

16:57.750 --> 16:59.500
Okay, finished!

17:00.790 --> 17:02.920
I totally forgot to sleep...

17:03.670 --> 17:06.210
But it looks so much better now!

17:16.290 --> 17:18.880
I'm so glad you like it.

17:22.330 --> 17:25.380
S-sorry, I caught a little cold.

17:25.670 --> 17:28.380
I don't want you to get sick, so I'll head out...

17:31.540 --> 17:35.960
I-I'm okay, really! You don't have to worry about me!

17:38.670 --> 17:40.040
Trans Magia.

17:47.170 --> 17:49.130
Alice-chan...

18:04.080 --> 18:06.750
Did Alice take me to...

18:10.830 --> 18:11.460
Huh?

18:14.540 --> 18:20.250
Oh, Doctor... I think I have a cold.

18:23.290 --> 18:25.880
You want me to open my mouth?

18:39.420 --> 18:43.290
Okay, I'll take it off...

18:57.080 --> 19:02.380
Please, Doctor... Examine me.

19:21.170 --> 19:23.710
Doctor...

19:40.790 --> 19:43.830
Will that cream help?

19:54.290 --> 19:57.210
I-it feels so good!

20:01.040 --> 20:02.960
I need a shot?

20:03.250 --> 20:13.460
Doctor, I'm scared... so please... be gentle.

20:18.790 --> 20:22.790
K..Korisu-chan? Was I...

20:32.630 --> 20:34.040
My cold's gone!

20:36.040 --> 20:37.790
Thank you, Korisu-chan!

20:39.170 --> 20:41.460
Wait, for real?

20:41.460 --> 20:42.750
U..uh-huh.

20:43.710 --> 20:49.830
You got sick? I wish you'd told me.
I would've come and taken care of you!

20:49.830 --> 20:53.710
Um... but Korisu-chan used her powers to cure my cold!

20:53.920 --> 20:56.330
That's crazy, Korisu.

20:59.460 --> 21:04.710
I could use Korisu's powers to get Utena-chan
to pretend to be my wittle baby!

21:05.630 --> 21:08.380
Think you can make that happen, Korisu?

21:09.710 --> 21:12.750
Wait, what? What're you whispering?

21:20.500 --> 21:27.080
Hey! What the hell is this?! Lemme out! Korisu!

21:29.040 --> 21:30.670
I'm home!

21:31.330 --> 21:33.290
Sorry I'm so late.

21:33.790 --> 21:37.130
Grandma says she's coming by for a visit next week.

21:37.500 --> 21:41.960
She wants to bring a present. Do you want another dolly?

21:45.080 --> 21:45.880
You sure?

21:47.830 --> 21:53.290
You've been in such a good mood these days.
Did you make some new friends?

21:56.540 --> 21:58.710
Really? That's great!

22:08.170 --> 22:13.830
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

22:14.000 --> 22:16.830
Chotto warui ko nano sorry

22:17.710 --> 22:19.960
Ijiwaru shitai

22:20.250 --> 22:25.880
Toutosa matte yosasugite honto shindoi kami oshi na anata ni

22:26.040 --> 22:33.000
Sasageru ai no katachi tobikiri no togetoge sadistic

22:33.170 --> 22:35.960
Madamada yumemigachi na shojo

22:36.210 --> 22:39.080
Akogareteita no wa shujinkou

22:39.250 --> 22:44.830
Nande watashi wa sou narenai no? Nante ochikonda keredo

22:44.830 --> 22:50.710
Doki tte kizuichatta kanjou mahou ni kakatte daibousou

22:50.830 --> 22:53.790
Benkyou mo nichijou mo te ni tsukanakute

22:53.790 --> 22:56.960
Mousou shichau risou no situation

22:57.130 --> 23:02.330
Bakudan mitai ni asobu no datte

23:02.710 --> 23:08.210
Waruku wa nai no ka mo ne

23:08.210 --> 23:13.880
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

23:14.040 --> 23:19.750
Chanto jibun nari no story aruite yukou for me

23:20.130 --> 23:22.290
Ano ko no motto kagayaite

23:22.290 --> 23:25.830
Motto shigekiteki na sugata mitai kara

23:26.040 --> 23:33.080
Uketotte ai no katachi tobikiri no kodawari na fetish

23:36.170 --> 23:41.040
<b>The Tres Magia's Secret Backstory</b>
